{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43249","headline":"秋日悬清光 · 陶拱","name":"秋日悬清光","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"秋至云容歛，天中日景清。\n悬空寒色净，委照曙光盈。\n泫泫看弥上，辉辉望最明。\n烟霞轮乍透，葵藿影初生。\n鉴下应无极，升高自有程。\n何当回盛彩，一爲表精诚。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陶拱","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43249.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43249","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}